2:T797,<br><h2>The <span class="ident">VoiceoverGuy Studio</span> kit</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.neumann.com/en-gb/products/microphones/u-87-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Neumann U87">Neumann U87</a>, TLM 103, and <a href="https://www.sennheiser.com/en-us/catalog/products/microphones/mkh-416-p48u3/mkh-416-p48u3-001511" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Sennheiser MKH 416">Sennheiser MKH 416</a>. 
<br><a href="https://www.adobe.com/uk/products/audition.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Adobe Audition VoiceoverGuy">Adobe Audition</a> recording software.<br>
<a href="https://www.uaudio.com/products/apollo-x4" class="isred" target="_blank" title="Apollo X4" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apollo X4</a> and <a href="https://www.uaudio.com/products/apollo-x6" class="isred" target="_blank" title="Apollo X6" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apollo X6</a> Audio Interfaces.

<br><a href="https://www.uaudio.com/products/neve-1073-collection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="NEVE 1073 Pre Amp">NEVE 1073</a>, <a href="https://www.uaudio.com/products/teletronix-la-2a-tube-compressor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="LA-2A">LA-2A</a> and  <a href="https://www.uaudio.com/products/neve-88rs-collection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="NEVE 88RS">NEVE 88RS</a> Pre Amps<br>

We even love the conveniency of 2 <a href="https://www.elgato.com/us/en/s/explore-stream-deck" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Stream Deck">Stream Deck</a> units.<br>

<b>Listen in and direct the session with:</b><br>
<a href="https://nexus.source-elements.com/voiceoverguy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Source Connect NEXUS">Source Connect NEXUS, </a>
<a href="https://cleanfeed.net/join?voiceoverguy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="VoiceoverGuy Cleanfeed link">Cleanfeed</a>, SessionLinkPro, Zoom & Teams.</p>0:["tAFgy3oTCENJzQlp2G2wa",[[["",{"children":["voiceover-studio",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["voiceover-studio",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>Yorkshire Voiceover <span class=\"ident\">Studio</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>My professional voiceover studio based in West Yorkshire rivals some of the London facilities, with a 2022 refit.<br>\r\nIt’s loaded with the latest technology and is connectable in every way possible for you to direct the voice session.<br>\r\n<b>360° tour below.</b> Click the mouse and move left, right up and down to see the whole studio.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"studio-tour-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/studiotour/index.html","title":"360\\u00B0 VoiceoverGuy Studio Tour","allowFullScreen":true}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio1.jpg","alt":"Voiceover Studio \\u2013 VoiceoverGuy","title":"Voiceover Studio \\u2013 VoiceoverGuy","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio7.jpg","alt":"Yorkshire Voiceover Studio","title":"Yorkshire Voiceover Studio","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Listen and Direct </span>the Voiceover Session</h2>\r\n<p>There’s no need to travel. Most clients now direct remotely, live in HD quality, using Source Connect, Cleanfeed, or Zoom. You can listen in, give feedback, and guide the read in real time.<br>\r\n\r\nGuy is regularly directed live for his in demand <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Impression Voiceover\">David Attenborough impression</a>, used in TV, web, radio, and social media campaigns. If you’re after a natural history-style voiceover with warmth and wit, this is where to start.\r\n</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>A <span class=\"ident\">Cleanfeed </span>Studio</h2>\r\n<p>Clean feed is awesome! It’s an awesome way to connect the Voiceover to a Studio, or even to connect you remotely to listen in with the cost of hiring a studio. All you need is Google Chrome. <br>Guy will send you his Cleanfeed link.</a> Simply open in Chrome and listen in High Quality or record your end without needing to book a studio. Click the <a href=\"https://cleanfeed.net/\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cleanfeed Website\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cleanfeed website</a> for more details.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio3.jpg","alt":"West Yorkshire Voiceover Studio","title":"West Yorkshire Voiceover Studio","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio4.jpg","alt":"Leeds Voiceover Studio","title":"Leeds Voiceover Studio","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><span class=\"ident\">Source Connect </span>NEXUS & Standard</h2>\r\n<p>Source-Connect Now enables audio direction between the studio and your Mac or PC using Google Chrome. You can also literally be anywhere in the world and connect. <br>\r\n<a href=\"https://nexus.source-elements.com/voiceoverguy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Source Connect NEXUS\">Click the link, </a> and it allows direct-to-the-timeline recording with real-time, broadcast-quality audio using only your internet connection. Many great sessions have been directed this way.</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><span class=\"ident\">Need a Voiceover or Podcast Studio in Yorkshire?</span></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nLooking for a professional recording space in West Yorkshire? This studio is used by ITV, BBC, and top podcast\r\nproducers to connect guests remotely or record interviews in broadcast quality.<br>\r\nWhether you’re interviewing a guest for a podcast, directing a remote voice session, or need a Source Connect–enabled\r\nstudio for a live radio link-up, it’s all here.<br>\r\nIf you specifically need a dedicated podcast space, take a look at my\r\n<a href=\"/yorkshire-podcast-studio\" title=\"Yorkshire Podcast Studio for hire\">Yorkshire podcast studio</a> page for more\r\ndetails and example sessions.\r\n</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio5.jpg","alt":"Voiceover Studio for Hire in West Yorkshire","title":"Voiceover Studio for Hire in West Yorkshire","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio6.jpg","alt":"Professional Voiceover Booth in Yorkshire","title":"Professional Voiceover Booth in Yorkshire","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Need a Yorkshire Studio for <span class=\"ident\">Interviews?</span></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nFrom live radio link-ups to remote podcast interviews, this studio connects guests across the UK and beyond.<br>\r\nUsed by ITV’s Emmerdale, BBC, Heart and even Kammy, it’s perfect for producers needing a local voice or expert. <br>\r\nThat’s exactly why <a class=\"ident\" href=\"https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Voiceover Studio Finder\">Voiceover Studio Finder</a> was created, to help producers find studios like this, wherever they need them.\r\n</p>"}}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><span class=\"ident\">Voiceover Studio Hire in Yorkshire</span></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nLooking for a professional voice studio to rent in Yorkshire? Set in a discreet, easily accessible location with private\r\nparking, this studio is trusted by voiceover talent from ITV’s <em>Emmerdale</em> and even football legend Chris Kamara.<br>\r\nPart of the <a class=\"ident\" href=\"https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/\" title=\"Voiceover Studio Finder\" target=\"_blank\">Voiceover Studio Finder</a> network, it’s fully equipped for remote sessions and in-person recordings.<br>\r\nIf you have further questions do check out our <a href=\"/FAQ\" title=\"FAQ Page\">FAQ Page</a>.\r\n<a class=\"ident\" href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch with Guy\" target=\"_blank\">Get in touch</a> to check availability\r\nor view <a class=\"ident\" href=\"https://voiceoverstudiofinder.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"Guy’s Studio on Voiceover Studio Finder\" target=\"_blank\">Guy’s studio profile</a> on Voiceover Studio Finder for more technical specs and photos.\r\n</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/studio/voiceoverguy-voicover-studio2.jpg","alt":"Wakefield Voiceover Studio","title":"Wakefield Voiceover Studio","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]}]]}]]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfilePage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio#profilepage\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#guyharris\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"jobTitle\":\"British Male Voiceover Artist\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/voiceoverguy/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/user/voiceoverguyharris\"],\"description\":\"Professional voiceover studio in Wakefield, West Yorkshire. Take a 360° virtual tour and see the broadcast-quality recording setup used by Guy Harris.\"}}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#business\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris Voiceover\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio\",\"priceRange\":\"£100–£5000\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Wakefield\",\"addressRegion\":\"West Yorkshire\",\"addressCountry\":\"GB\"},\"openingHours\":\"Mo-Sa 07:00-21:00\",\"description\":\"Professional voiceover recording studio in Wakefield, West Yorkshire offering broadcast-quality audio, same-day delivery and remote session capability.\"}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is the voiceover studio located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The studio is in Wakefield, West Yorkshire, within easy reach of Leeds and the wider Yorkshire region, with free on-site parking.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I hire the studio for my own voice work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, the studio is available to hire for voiceover and podcast sessions and has been used by actors from Emmerdale and other national broadcasters.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I connect remotely to direct a session?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, remote direction is available via Source Connect, Cleanfeed, Nexus, Zoom or a simple phone patch so you can listen in and direct in real time from anywhere.\"}}]}"}}]]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","voiceover-studio","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L4",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/913cecfa117908b5.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":[["$","head",null,{"children":[["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","hr